# Belt-and-suspenders: never accidentally commit strategy materials
# (these live outside the repo by design, but in case of misconfig).
# Note: gitignore patterns are evaluated against repo-relative paths and
# don't traverse `..`, so a `../strategy/` entry would be a no-op — the
# real defense is the pre-commit hook installed by
# strategy/scripts/install-public-repo-hooks.sh.
strategy/
**/competitive-analysis.md
**/PRD.md
**/PRD-*.md
**/task-breakdown*.md
